# infestation.vrs: undead-hordes D24. The inf-test event (tools/vrclient/scenarios/fixtures/inf-test.json: an
# Infestation of Faction_Undead, 3 origins of at least 5 natives 300 m apart, 10 CHAR_Undead_SkeletonSoldier_Withered
# at level 20 each, hunters 50, spread 1-3 from the Withered pool) starts with Chaos at (-1690, -1400), the apocalypse sessions'
# wait spot, outside his castle territory (a refuge: no hunter targets a player inside it) with open ground to the origins
# (A7: hunters jump in straight lines, so a spot past a cliff band or river is never reached). Its origins must lie at
# least 300 m from Chaos (A7); at least half of the hunter share (8 of the 15 hunters of 30) must stand within 100 m of Chaos
# within 5 minutes (wild Withered within 100 m of Chaos before the start are subtracted). Three CHAR_Bandit_Thug natives
# (`.devnative`, never the mod's units; Session 0's Hostility table: bandits fight the undead) then spawn beside the
# first hunter listed (Chaos stands there to spawn them): a spread of 1-3 is logged within 3 minutes. `.nyar event stop` ends it and drains to 0 tracked.
# Needs: `python tools/vrclient/fixture-install.py <server>/BepInEx/config/Nyarlathotep/events.json inf-test` before the
# boot (or `.nyar event reload` below); the dev cfg at MaxTrackedUnits 300 (the pillar switch below re-reads it);
# NyarDevTools (.devwhere .devunits .devnative) and DevChatEcho; pillar spawns on; no other event running; Chaos
# invulnerable (`ToggleInvulnerable true`, a Boolean, never false).
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 5
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
chat .devtp -1690 -1400
expect-log \[DEV TP\] to
wait 4
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
chat .nyar pillar spawns on
expect-reply spawns
chat .nyar event reload
expect-log events: reloaded
expect-no-log event inf-test: timeout=3
chat .devwhere
expect-log \[DEV WHERE\] x=(?P<HX>-?[0-9.]+) y=-?[0-9.]+ z=(?P<HZ>-?[0-9.]+)
chat .devunits -1584807109 100
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\] n=(?P<WILD>[0-9]+) prefab=-1584807109
mark
chat .nyar event start inf-test
expect-log event inf-test started by timeout=20
expect-log apocalypse inf-test hotspots: 3 \([0-9]+ at (?P<AX>-?[0-9]+) (?P<AZ>-?[0-9]+), [0-9]+ at (?P<BX>-?[0-9]+) (?P<BZ>-?[0-9]+), [0-9]+ at (?P<CX>-?[0-9]+) (?P<CZ>-?[0-9]+)\) timeout=30
calc DMIN = min(hypot(${AX} - ${HX}, ${AZ} - ${HZ}), hypot(${BX} - ${HX}, ${BZ} - ${HZ}), hypot(${CX} - ${HX}, ${CZ} - ${HZ}))
expect-calc ${DMIN} >= 300
expect-log apocalypse inf-test roamers: \+10 at hotspot 1 timeout=60
expect-log apocalypse inf-test roamers: \+10 at hotspot 2 timeout=60
expect-log apocalypse inf-test roamers: \+10 at hotspot 3 timeout=60
poll-reply RISE tracked units: 30 \(spawning 0, :: .nyar status every=5 timeout=120
# the hunters come to Chaos: the run's Withered within 100 m at 2.5 and at 5 minutes after the rise (the last counts)
wait 150
chat .devunits -1584807109 100
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\] n=(?P<N1>[0-9]+) prefab=-1584807109
wait 145
chat .devunits -1584807109 100
expect-log \[DEV UNIT\] 0 x=(?P<UX>-?[0-9.]+) y=-?[0-9.]+ z=(?P<UZ>-?[0-9.]+)
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\] n=(?P<N>[0-9]+) prefab=-1584807109
calc HUNTERS = ${N} - ${WILD}
expect-calc ${HUNTERS} >= 8
shot full inf-hunters
# natives among them (the hunters stand 40-60 m from Chaos: the jump ring), beside the first one listed: a kill by the
# run's units spreads 1-3
chat .devtp ${UX} ${UZ}
expect-log \[DEV TP\] to
wait 3
console ToggleInvulnerable true
mark
chat .devnative -301730941 3 300
expect-log \[DEV NATIVE\] n=3
expect-log apocalypse inf-test spread: \+(?P<SPREAD>[0-9]+) \( timeout=180
expect-calc ${SPREAD} >= 1 and ${SPREAD} <= 3
shot full inf-spread
chat .nyar event stop inf-test
expect-log event inf-test stopped timeout=20
poll-reply DRAIN tracked units: 0 \(spawning 0, despawning 0\) :: .nyar status every=3 timeout=180
